#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:2 e52fd218ce2a4d82839ea7fa06d0a24a
msgid "_`Task slices`"
msgstr ""
"_`任务切片`"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:4 43834a55a0c04986965e4b8184525050
msgid ""
"The API reference answers \"what does this function take\". This section "
"answers the other question: **\"I have a task; which pieces do I need, "
"and how do they go together.\"** One page per task, not per header."
msgstr ""
"API 参考回答的是“这个函数收什么参数”。本节回答另一个问题： **“我有一个任"
"务，需要哪些部件，它们又怎么接在一起。”** 一页一个任务，而不是一个头文件"
"一页。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:8 99c437715bc14cf698ea144c3f95642b
msgid ""
"Every slice page has the same seven parts, so a page you have read once "
"teaches you where to look on the next one:"
msgstr ""
"每个切片页都有相同的七个部分，因此读过一页，下一页该往哪里看就已经知道了"
"："

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:11 393bec9a58e44f2e82d9dc57b6a395fc
msgid "**The task** -- the question in the words a user would use."
msgstr ""
"**任务** ——用使用者会用的措辞提出的问题。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:12 39af89dc07ab47a38e46a4107f88f44f
msgid "**What you need** -- the headers, and what each one is for."
msgstr ""
"**所需部件** ——需要哪些头文件，以及每个头文件是做什么的。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:13 ff706804efc64a628f49f5a5cb44ab03
msgid ""
"**A minimal program** -- compiled with this repository's own flags, in "
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/``."
msgstr ""
"**最小程序** ——用本仓库自己的编译选项编译，位于 ``"
"docs/doxygen/dox/demos/`` 。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:15 c0b693da943843f38a957165b990268b
msgid ""
"**Where the numbers come from** -- which nameplate field or helper "
"produces each constant, because a retyped gain is a second machine."
msgstr ""
"**数字的来源** ——每个常数由哪个铭牌字段或辅助函数产生，因为一个重抄的增"
"益就是第二台电机。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:17 c81cd067f96a47148f44c5dc2864fd20
msgid "**How it goes wrong** -- the failure modes that compile cleanly."
msgstr ""
"**失效方式** ——那些能干净编译的失效模式。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:18 b50461c68d2444f385f77bfc1934612a
msgid ""
"**Evidence** -- which claim rows cover the slice, and what the slice does"
" not claim."
msgstr ""
"**证据** ——哪些主张行覆盖本切片，以及本切片不主张什么。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:20 66ead6dae25c4b19a64c4ea2865e853f
msgid ""
"**Figure** -- produced by ``docs/demos/make_figures.py``, never hand-"
"drawn."
msgstr ""
"**图** ——由 ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` 生成，从不手绘。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:22 a970ea21c281497fa775ae436c3245a3
msgid "Two rules apply to every page and are worth stating once:"
msgstr ""
"有两条规则适用于每一页，值得在这里说一次："

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:24 5448a9eee011462cbb1badb039260f6a
msgid ""
"**The evidence level is the minimum of the slice's claim rows**, and the "
"level itself lives in the claim table in the project ``README.md``. No "
"page in this section repeats a level or a measured number; a number "
"copied into a page is a second source of truth with a shelf life."
msgstr ""
"**证据等级是切片各主张行中的最小值** ，而等级本身住在项目 ``README.md`` "
"的主张表里。本节没有任何一页重述等级或实测数字；抄进页面的数字是第二个事"
"实来源，且有保质期。"

#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:28 199fed51434a4912a3bd2d6f9b886225
msgid ""
"**The figure shows what it shows.** Where a slice's headline number is "
"not visible in the figure, the page says so rather than choosing a figure"
" that looks like it agrees."
msgstr ""
"**图只展示它展示的东西。** 当切片的关键数字在图上不可见时，页面会明说，"
"而不是挑一张看起来对得上的图。"

