#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:94 c556e0dd66a74953ac915b95b3994f43
msgid ""
"A slice is ``written`` when its page carries all seven parts and its "
"example compiles. **All nine are written**, which makes the list above "
"the boundary of what this section promises rather than a forecast: a task"
" that is not in it is not covered here, and the pieces column says what "
"it would take to add it."
msgstr ""
"一个切片在其页面包含全部七个部分、且示例能够编译时，才算 ``written`` 。 "
"**九个切片都已写就** ，这使得上表成为本节所承诺范围的边界，而不是一份预"
"测：不在其中的任务，这里不覆盖；部件列说明要加入一个任务需要什么。"

