#: ../../source/guides/index.rst:116 ddba2b15fa7144e39609277f29ee065f
msgid ""
":doc:`../demos/index` holds the SIL traces that the figure step draws on."
" They are scenario pages rather than task pages: a scenario says \"watch "
"the loop do this\", a slice says \"here is what to wire on your "
"machine\"."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../demos/index` 收录了图这一节所依据的 SIL 轨迹。它们是场景页而不"
"是任务页：场景页说“看这个环这样动作”，切片说“在自己的机器上要接哪些线”。"

